    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d744">

                <pb facs="0848" n="756" xml:id="pg756"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/9023</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The French Ambassador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Jusserand</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Counselor for the Department of State</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Polk</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-02-12">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 12, 1918</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Counselor</hi>: The urgent telegram I
                    alluded to in our talk yesterday arrived piecemeal and the last part (supposing
                    it be really the last part which is not quite clear) reached me only this
                    afternoon.</p>
                <p>You will find herewith a paraphrase of it. Will you be so good as to let me know
                    whether the American Government may decide to join us in the very urgent and
                    important <hi rendition="#italic">démarche</hi> to be made with the Roumanian
                    King.</p>
                <p>Believe me [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jusserand</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d744-a1.xml" xpointer="d744-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
